  work_order: wo-e50c8f7e3b5d
  source_lineage: ai-assisted-classification.md
  notes: >-
    Obsidian plugin (by HyeonseoNam) that classifies notes against three
    reference modes: all tags in the vault, a filtered regex subset, or a
    manual hand-curated category list (the supervised "bucketing" pattern,
    built in). Works with any OpenAI-compatible API (OpenAI, local Ollama,
    LocalAI) and can also use the Jina AI Classifier, which has a free tier.
